{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11112270","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11112270","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1111227001:1":{"text":"道中の嫌がらせは全部あんたの仕業だったのね！","source_cn":"原来路上那些乱七八糟的乱子都是你在捣鬼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E82F367F999A7AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1111227002:1":{"text":"だって、アンお姉ちゃんに行ってほしくなかったんだもん！お姉ちゃんを奪ったお前のせいだ！","source_cn":"因为卡卡不希望安丹姐姐离开！都怪你要抢走安丹姐姐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1962B887B7147628","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111227003:1":{"text":"誰も奪ってなんかいないわよ！","source_cn":"我可没有抢你的安丹姐姐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x401742B529FDAB76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111227004:1":{"text":"砂漠は今とても危険な上に、アンには死の災いが待ってるの！","source_cn":"如今的沙漠凶流暗涌，安丹的命数里又藏有生死之灾！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BA4C3FB68619149","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111227005:1":{"text":"あたしたちと一緒に行かなかったら、アンお姉ちゃんが死んじゃうかもしれないのよ？","source_cn":"要是不与我们同行的话，你不怕死神抢走你的安丹姐姐？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAC2FE7F290ED93E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111227006:1":{"text":"それでもまだ、あんたが彼女を守るとでも言うの！？","source_cn":"难道，你认为自己能保护安丹德拉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A68969063F1D169","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111227007:1":{"text":"ココがアンお姉ちゃんを守れるかは分からないけど、でも……ココは守りたいの！","source_cn":"卡卡不一定能保护安丹姐姐，但是……卡卡想要保护安丹姐姐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70F75AE09EC429DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111227008:1":{"text":"ココはもう子どもじゃない！強いし、戦うのだって怖くないもん！","source_cn":"卡卡是大孩子，可以战斗！也不怕战斗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x979A518230F79EEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111227009:1":{"text":"でも誰もココを信じてくれない……ココにチャンスをくれない！","source_cn":"可是你们不相信卡卡……不愿意给卡卡一个机会！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4498CAD19E77BEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1111227010:1":{"text":"ココ……","source_cn":"卡卡……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EE98FB7703E6FC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111227011:1":{"text":"君にそこまで言ってもらえるなんて、私は神に愛されているんだな。","source_cn":"能听到你说这些话，我觉得自己是个被神明关爱的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18984211587A3DDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1111227012:1":{"text":"ありがとう。","source_cn":"谢谢你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC0A9A835308C516","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1111227013:1":{"text":"君に戦う覚悟ができているのなら、これ以上止めはしない。","source_cn":"如果你已经做好了战斗的觉悟，我也不阻止你了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AB8D9759CBBA1F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1111227014:1":{"text":"砂漠はいかなる闘志も裏切らない。勇敢なババリアは必ずや認めてもらえる。","source_cn":"沙漠不会辜负任何一缕斗志，蛮血的勇敢必将得到认可。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x247D0E0738ED0DED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1111227015:1":{"text":"あんなデカい岩を動かせたんだ、戦力にはなるんじゃないか。","source_cn":"我看她有点能耐，起码能搬动那么大的石头。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD807874EAD354DCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1111227016:1":{"text":"さすがに岩はココさんのクマさんが運んだのでは？","source_cn":"唔，石头应该是卡卡身边那只熊搬的吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1BBBE62DD612E54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1111227017:1":{"text":"まあでも、その年齢で猛獣を飼い慣らせるなんて、十分すごいです。","source_cn":"不过，小小年纪能够驱使猛兽，也算值得认可。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D54FA0E81D3E436","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1111227018:1":{"text":"それにココさんはクリムゾン高原の地形にも詳しいようですし、道案内もできるのでは？","source_cn":"而且卡卡对深红高原的地形比较熟悉，可以给我们当向导。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x812EC98E8359F596","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1111227019:1":{"text":"マスター、ココさんも一緒に連れて行きますか？","source_cn":"主人，你同意卡卡加入吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5BF19AAA2790236F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マスター、ココさんも一緒に連れて行きますか？","female":"マスター、ココさんも一緒に連れて行きますか？","variant_male_record_index":"124489","variant_female_record_index":"124490","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:24:1111227019":{"text":"マスター、ココさんも一緒に連れて行きますか？","source_cn":"主人，你同意卡卡加入吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5BF19AAA2790236F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マスター、ココさんも一緒に連れて行きますか？","female":"マスター、ココさんも一緒に連れて行きますか？","variant_male_record_index":"124489","variant_female_record_index":"124490","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1111227020:3":{"text":"……言っとくけど、あたし、子どもの世話は苦手だからね。","source_cn":"哼……丑话说在前头，我不擅长照顾小孩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7008A1422E22